    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">If this option is exercised prior to the end of the Retention Period (as defined in footnote (3)), the exercise price per share for such exercise shall be $13.48, the original exercise price per share, and not the New Exercise Price (as defined in footnote (3)) reflected in Column 2.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">1/4th of the shares subject to the option shall vest on February 9, 2027, and 1/48th of the shares subject to the option shall vest in monthly installments thereafter, subject to the Reporting Person's continuous service through each vesting date, inclusive.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">On August 14, 2026, the stockholders of the Issuer approved a proposal to reprice certain eligible outstanding stock options, including the stock options with exercise prices of $13.48, $11.29 and $4.24 listed in Table II (the &quot;Repriced Options&quot;). In accordance with this approval, on November 6, 2026, the exercise price of each Repriced Option was reduced to $1.26 (the &quot;New Exercise Price&quot;); provided that, for the New Exercise Price to apply, the Reporting Person must remain in Continuous Service (as defined in the applicable equity plan governing such option) with the Issuer from November 6, 2026 until the earlier of (i) November 6, 2027 and (ii) a Change in Control (as defined in the applicable equity plan governing such option) during the Reporting Person's Continuous Service with the Issuer (upon which such option shall accelerate in full) (such period, the &quot;Retention Period&quot;).</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">(Continued from footnote 3) Following the repricing, each Repriced Option retains its respective original vesting schedule and expiration date.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">If this option is exercised prior to the end of the Retention Period, the exercise price per share for such exercise shall be $11.29, the original exercise price per share, and not the New Exercise Price reflected in Column 2.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F6">1/4th of the shares subject to the option vested on June 11, 2026, and 1/48th of the shares subject to the option vested or shall vest in monthly installments thereafter, subject to the Reporting Person's continuous service through each vesting date, inclusive.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F7">If this option is exercised prior to the end of the Retention Period, the exercise price per share for such exercise shall be $4.24, the original exercise price per share, and not the New Exercise Price reflected in Column 2.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F8">1/48th of the original number of shares subject to the option vested on July 27, 2024, and 1/48th of the original number of shares subject to the option vested or shall vest in monthly installments thereafter, subject to the Reporting Person's continuous service through each vesting date, inclusive.</footnote>
